  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;The information submitted fails to adequately account for\r\nthe onsite protected trees by way of, failure to include all trees present and\r\nthe lack of submission of an Arboricultural Impact Assessment with tree\r\nprotection and any removal measures. As such it cannot be determined that\r\nsignificant harm would not be caused to the protected trees as a result of this\r\ndevelopment which warrants a refusal of the application, by Policies 79, 80 of\r\nLP1 (2024), g7 of the London Plan (2021) and N2 of the NPPF (2026).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The submitted landscaping information is inaccurate as\r\nit fails to describe or show an accurate state of the existing site, and\r\nfurther details are required to be submitted with regard to the levels and\r\ntopography of the site following the clearance works and therefore significant\r\nharm may be caused to character and biodiversity of the site by way of unclear\r\nlandscaping proposals which is contrary to Policies 79, 80 of LP1\r\n(2024), g7 of the London Plan (2021) and N2 of the NPPF (2026).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ]
